From d70e32a765042d88a4a6f6d9d338ba00b5890ed9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mohammadzafar Ziya <mohammadzafar.ziya@imgtec.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 19:02:30 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 23/24] pvr: Instrument draw and transfer u_trace markers

Add marker-based u_trace instrumentation for compute, draw
and transfer commands during command buffer recording.

Emit begin/end tracepoints for compute, draw operations, and
transfer operations, and pass the command buffer object ID to
associate trace events with individual command buffers.

Draw tracepoints cover draw, draw indexed, draw indirect
indexed, and draw indirect.

Transfer tracepoints cover blit, image copy, buffer copy,
buffer-to-image, image-to-buffer, and fill operations.

Extend the marker-based u_trace infrastructure to support graphics,
compute, and transfer workloads. Add operation annotations
for draw and transfer workloads, allowing individual command types to be
identified in trace output.

Signed-off-by: Mohammadzafar Ziya <mohammadzafar.ziya@imgtec.com>
Reviewed-by: Luigi Santivetti <luigi.santivetti@imgtec.com>
Tested-by: Gyeyoung Baek <gye976@gmail.com>
Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/43853>
(cherry picked from commit 51048338d3db061641003a4b18daec821792307d)
